<title>POLAND: ECHO EXTENDS CPS PROGRAMME TO PLN 50 MLN.</title>
<headline>ECHO EXTENDS CPS PROGRAMME TO PLN 50 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish developer Echo Investment SA has signed an agreement with Raiffeisen Centrobank SA on increasing its commercial papers programme to 50 million zlotys, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>In October last year, the firm issued 1.5-million-zloty worth commercial papers.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
